#!/usr/bin/env rexx
/*
    Author:     Rony G. Flatscher
    Date:       2016-11-07
    Purpose:    Demonstrate how to use DO...OVER and (starting with ooRexx 5) DO WITH...OVER with

                - java.lang.Enum class objects
                     - MAKEARRAY will supply all enum Java objects
                     - SUPPLIER will supply as index the ordinal value and as item the enum Java object

                  or with Java objects implementing one of the following interfaces:

                - java.lang.Iterable
                - java.util.Collection
                - java.util.Enumeration
                - java.util.Iterator
                     - MAKEARRAY will supply the collected values
                     - SUPPLIER will supply as index and item the collected value (as if they were ooRexx Bags)

                - java.util.Map
                     - MAKEARRAY will supply the key values
                     - SUPPLIER will supply as index the key and as item the value stored with the key

    Needs:      BSF4ooRexx
                ooRexx 5.0 or later

    Changed:    2016-12-21, rgf: make sure that "DO WITH" is run on ooRexx 5.0.0 or higher
                2018-10-07, rgf: use new entry .bsf4rexx~rexx.version
                2022-01-20, rgf: - removed checks for ooRexx 5.0 or later as previous versions of ooRexx
                                   would cause a syntax error already
                                 - refactored the routines to proper Rexx programs to ease spotting
                                   DoOver samples that may be of interest to the programmer

    License:

    ------------------------ Apache Version 2.0 license -------------------------
       Copyright (C) 2016-2018 Rony G. Flatscher

       Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the "License");
       you may not use this file except in compliance with the License.
       You may obtain a copy of the License at

           http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

       Unless required by applicable law or agreed to in writing, software
       distributed under the License is distributed on an "AS IS" BASIS,
       WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied.
       See the License for the specific language governing permissions and
       limitations under the License.
    -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*/

pgm=.array~of("1-071_demoDoOver_Enum.rxj",     "1-072_demoDoOver_Map.rxj", -
              "1-073_demoDoOver_Iterable.rxj", "1-074_demoDoOver_Iterator.rxj", -
              "1-075_demoDoOver_Enumeration.rxj")
do p over pgm
   say "calling" pp(p) "..."
   say
   call (p) -- call the ooRexx program
end

::requires "BSF.CLS" -- get Java support